@*
===========================================================
ORANGE TENDER MANAGEMENT SYSTEM
PAGE: Submit Full Report to Sourcing Manager

DEVELOPER OWNER: UNASSIGNED — Team assignment required
MODULE: Sourcing Officer / Reports
TRELLO TASK: None — no dedicated Trello card
TRELLO URL: —

PURPOSE:
The Officer submits the full detailed report
(FullEvaluation) to the Sourcing Manager.

BUSINESS ACCESS:
Sourcing Officer

ROUTE: /SourcingOfficer/Reports/SubmitToManager/{id?}

FUTURE IMPLEMENTATION:
- POST: submit the FullEvaluation version (SubmittedAt);
  Tender.Status = ManagerReview; notify the Manager; audit.

DEPENDENCIES:
TenderReports, Tenders, Notifications, AuditLogs.

STATUS:
UI SCAFFOLD ONLY — BUSINESS LOGIC NOT IMPLEMENTED.

IMPORTANT:
Required report lifecycle step (spec §4.4, §4.6, §11); no
Trello card covers it — team assignment required.
===========================================================
*@
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Submit Full Report to Sourcing Manager";
    ViewData["WorkspaceSection"] = "Reports";
    ViewData["Description"] = "Send the full detailed evaluation report to the Sourcing Manager.";
}
<partial name="_PageHeader" />
<partial name="_ScaffoldNotice" />

<section class="ws-panel pg-panel">
    <h2>Report to submit</h2>
    <dl class="pg-dl">
        <div><dt>Tender</dt><dd>—</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Report version</dt><dd>—</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Evaluation round approved on</dt><dd>—</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Recommended offer</dt><dd>—</dd></div>
    </dl>
</section>

<section class="ws-panel pg-panel">
    <h2>Cover note for the Manager</h2>
    <form class="pg-form">
        <fieldset disabled>
            <div class="pg-form-grid">
                <div class="pg-field pg-field-wide"><label for="f-note-1">Note</label><textarea id="f-note-1" rows="4"></textarea><small class="pg-hint">Optional. The report itself is not edited here.</small></div>
            </div>
        </fieldset>
    </form>
</section>

<partial name="_ConfirmAction" model='new ConfirmActionModel("Submit to Sourcing Manager", "Send this report version to the Sourcing Manager for review.", "Sets the report version to Submitted and the tender to ManagerReview; the Manager is notified.", false, false)' />

<nav class="pg-links" aria-label="Related pages">
    <ul>
        <li><a asp-area="SourcingOfficer" asp-controller="Reports" asp-action="EvaluationResult">Committee result</a></li>
        <li><a asp-area="SourcingOfficer" asp-controller="Reports" asp-action="Index">All reports</a></li>
    </ul>
</nav>
